WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.870
The Team plan card still receives a prop
called legacyTheme.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:09.510
Does the card use it anywhere, or is the
billing page just passing it along?

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.950
Unused props checks the source for this
particular card.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:17.910
It shows where a prop was passed and whether
the component reads it or forwards it.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.990
With a matching source analysis loaded, open
Unused props.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.670
Under No reader found, expand legacyTheme.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:30.870
The billing page passes it here. The card
neither reads it nor passes it to a child.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:35.070
Now expand trackingId under Used, but easy to
miss.

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:38.310
Its click handler reads the ID when you pick
a plan.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.910
That makes legacyTheme a cleanup candidate at
this call site.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:44.070
Check other callers before removing it.
